## Open decisions

- The severity boost factor (× 2 by default; confirm with the sensitivity checks).
- The anemia time window (120 minutes is a team assumption).
- Whether a single "Unconscious or confused?" checkbox should raise urgency in the anemia scenario.
- Whether to add a Genie space on top of the dashboard.
- Whether the fallback tier (no confirmed candidate reachable) should boost a different criterion for severity instead of leaving the boost unused — currently it does nothing there, since `needed_services` isn't one of the fallback tier's criteria.
- Whether blood level's own smaller unknown-vs-default gap (blank `has_components`/`is_24x7` defaulting to tier 1) should eventually get the same confirmed/unconfirmed tiering as `needed_services`, or whether that's unnecessary since blood level is rarely a total data gap.

